Retry a chunk download the network cut off

Why: a restore retried a chunk only on io.ErrUnexpectedEOF, so one "connection reset by peer"
from B2 aborted a restore 22 hours and 98% into its download (the NAS GARAGE drill, 2026-10-21).
A reset, an aborted connection, a broken pipe or a timeout says nothing about the chunk, so those
now retry up to 8 times with a 2s doubling backoff capped at a minute.
Test: TestChunkDownloadRetriesNetworkErrors
Upstream: not submitted (upstreaming deferred, 2026-10-11).

